n of the line is\n\n$$\nr=p+tv\\,⟹\\,r=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nand the vector equation of the line segment $\\overset{―}{PQ}$ is\n\n$$\nr(t)=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in [0,1].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=2+1+0=3.\n$$" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378857 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378858 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378859 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378860 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378861 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1041 "selection" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378857 13194139535999 true] [17592186378856 1110 #uuid "00c51068-485c-516a-ab41-fa42d16f690a" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378857 1034 "3" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378857 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535999 true] [17592186378857 1111 #uuid "bb720808-7f35-5615-afa5-6d43cbbd150c" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378858 1034 "1" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378858 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535999 true] [17592186378858 1111 #uuid "ee08904c-1ca6-5ec9-8491-6f0fb337106b" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378859 1034 "-4" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378859 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535999 true] [17592186378859 1111 #uuid "6e9ef99c-866d-5c0a-a537-23721ae5d96d" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378860 1034 "0" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378860 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535999 true] [17592186378860 1111 #uuid "ddb8b6e2-3cf8-5294-bd42-8d8c52464407" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378861 1034 "-2" 13194139535999 true] [17592186378861 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535999 true] [17592186378861 1111 #uuid "194fb037-0dcc-591f-8d97-af54ea4d1008" 131941395